// Randomness generator file — rolls across every genre file.
// Lines starting with // are comments.
// The FIRST table is what rolls when the file is rolled.
// The Use: lines pull in each genre file by name,
// wherever it lives under your Generator root.
// Roll it from any note with `rdm:[@Genres]`
// or a two-genre mashup with `rdm:[@Genre Mashup]`
Title: Genres
Use: Fantasy.rdm
Use: Science Fiction.rdm
Use: Horror.rdm
Use: Mystery.rdm
Use: Thriller.rdm
Use: Romance.rdm
Use: Historical.rdm

Table: Genres
[@Fantasy]
[@Science Fiction]
[@Horror]
[@Mystery]
[@Thriller]
[@Romance]
[@Historical]

Table: Genre Mashup
[@Genres] meets [@Genres]
